  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【栃木県の温泉完全ガイド】名湯ランキング＆露天風呂付きおすすめ旅館10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">栃木県が誇る風情ある温泉街や隠れ家温泉リゾート。泉質の特徴や美肌効果、四季折々の絶景を楽しめる露天風呂、地元栃木県の旬の食材（栃木県名物料理・地場グルメ）を味わえる極上宿を紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 栃木県の温泉エリアとおすすめポイント</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-2\">日々の疲れをリフレッシュする天然温泉。カップルの記念日旅行、家族旅行、自分へのご褒美ステイに最適なエリアが揃っています。</p>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-950\">\n    <strong>注目の温泉・宿泊エリア：</strong> 日光・鬼怒川温泉\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 栃木県の主要エリア別おすすめ温泉宿</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-amber-500 font-bold\">♨️</span> 日光・鬼怒川温泉エリアの温泉・宿\n            </h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">栃木県を代表する観光名所・絶景スポット・名湯が凝縮された一番人気エリア。</p>\n            <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside bg-stone-50 p-3 rounded-xl\"><li><strong>グランピングリゾート　ブリリアントヴィレッジ日光</strong>（評価 ⭐4.6）</li><li><strong>アンワインドホテル＆バー奥日光　※２０２６年８月開業</strong>（評価 ⭐4.6）</li><li><strong>奥日光湯元温泉　湯元板屋</strong>（評価 ⭐4.6）</li></ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">💡 栃木県の温泉宿選び＆予約のコツ</h3>\n<ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n  <li><strong>客室露天風呂・貸切風呂：</strong> プライベートな空間で温泉を満喫したいカップル・ファミリーに大人気</li>\n  <li><strong>料理自慢の宿：</strong> 栃木県ならではの郷土料理やブランド牛、新鮮な山海の幸を堪能できるプランを選択</li>\n  <li><strong>お得な予約タイミング：</strong> 楽天トラベルの「5と0のつく日」や限定クーポンを活用してお得に予約</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設（追加セレクション）</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/28759/28759.jpg\" alt=\"日光中禅寺温泉　中禅寺金谷ホテル\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">日光中禅寺温泉　中禅寺金谷ホテル</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">栃木県日光市中宮祠2482 ｜ 日光宇都宮有料道路清滝IC～車で約25分（いろは坂経由）東武日光駅～無料送迎バス有（運行時間変動有）日光東照宮迄車40分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.49（877件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥14,750〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">日光国立公園内、中禅寺湖畔に建つログハウス風洋式ホテル。露天温泉「空ぶろ－ＳＯＲＡＢＵＲＯ－」有り。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D28759\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/135482/135482.jpg\" alt=\"日光湯元温泉　日光グランドホテル　ほのかな宿樹林\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">日光湯元温泉　日光グランドホテル　ほのかな宿樹林</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">栃木県日光市湯元2549-7 ｜ 東武日光駅バス湯元温泉行下車5分　日光東照宮車60分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.13（1147件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥11,500〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">【全室WiFi完備】★日光湯元白濁硫黄泉・源泉掛け流し♪自然と温泉のテーマパーク★</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D135482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/54978/54978.jpg\" alt=\"日光中禅寺湖温泉　ホテル花庵\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">日光中禅寺湖温泉　ホテル花庵</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">栃木県日光市中宮祠2480 ｜ ＪＲ日光駅又は東武日光駅より中禅寺温泉方面行きバス「中禅寺温泉バス停」下車。バス停より徒歩5分。日光東照宮より車で25分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.65（1282件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥18,000〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">全２０室の全ての客室から広大な中禅寺湖を眺める事が可能でございます。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D54978\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/31545/31545.jpg\" alt=\"日光温泉　ホテル　清晃苑\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">日光温泉　ホテル　清晃苑</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">栃木県日光市山内2350 ｜ ＪＲ日光駅・東武日光駅よりタクシーで約５分・路線バス７分・世界遺産めぐり行きホテル清晃苑前下車　日光東照宮まで徒歩1分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.33（538件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥10,450〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">世界遺産日光東照宮に一番近い宿！徒歩５分にあり観光の拠点として大変便利です。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D31545\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8337/8337.jpg\" alt=\"奥日光湯元温泉　奥日光高原ホテル\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">奥日光湯元温泉　奥日光高原ホテル</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">栃木県日光市湯元2549-6 ｜ お車で、日光道清滝I.Cより40分、関越道沼田I.Cより90分(冬季閉鎖)。電車・バスで、日光駅より路線バスで80分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.54（1079件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥11,827〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">本物の天然温泉にごり湯／喧騒を忘れられる奥日光の大自然</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D8337\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/40537/40537.jpg\" alt=\"光徳温泉　日光アストリアホテル\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">光徳温泉　日光アストリアホテル</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">栃木県日光市光徳温泉 ｜ 路線バス　湯元温泉行き（光徳経由）７０分　光徳温泉下車０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.12（535件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥14,400〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">奥日光戦場ヶ原光徳の一軒宿。春は新緑と花、夏は避暑地、秋は紅葉、冬はＸＣスキーでお楽しみ下さい。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D40537\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.